      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content Container -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl xl:max-w-8xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Executive Summary -->
    <section id="summary" class="mb-32">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-8">Executive Summary</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-light max-w-none">
        <p>
          RaskRask, a leading wellness platform in Denmark, faced challenges with their corporate booking system.
          Administrators found it difficult to manage treatments and track usage, while employees struggled with
          the booking process. Our mission was to streamline the experience for both user groups.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problem Statement -->
    <section id="problem" class="mb-32">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-8">Problem Statement</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-light max-w-none">
        <p>
          Corporate administrators lacked proper tools to manage their wellness programs effectively,
          leading to manual tracking and inefficient processes. Meanwhile, employees faced a
          disconnected booking experience that didn't reflect their company's specific offerings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-12">
        <div class="bg-surface/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6 shadow-card-light hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">Administrator Challenges</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">•</span>
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Difficulty tracking treatment usage and budgets</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">•</span>
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Manual processes for managing employee access</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
