                    </div>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-text-primary font-medium">Competitor Analysis</p>
                      <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Evaluated Vicuras, CityFys, and OnTheSpotMassage to identify industry standards and potential competitive advantages</p>
                    </div>
                  </li>
                </ul>
