                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-surface-deep/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
                    <span class="text-brand-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Created a state machine using XState to manage the complex booking flow, ensuring consistent user experiences across different paths and edge cases.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="text-text-primary font-medium mb-2">Performance Optimization</h4>
                <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
