                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 bg-surface-deep/50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                  <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
                    <span class="text-brand-primary font-medium">Solution:</span> Implemented virtualized lists, optimized re-renders with React.memo and useMemo, and added progressive loading for dashboard components.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
